#: scenario8:scenario8_3F20F6B5_7851_4BB9_A029_3CEBF40D25D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26e4adca1c3ee8bd65adf5e61cd4c80e8b183dfd78f6973f14775e34bdec8ec2
