msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Do away with such selfish desires and dedicate yourself to helping the people. ⟪k:1⟫The "
"power you have been given was bestowed upon you by the hand of God."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그러한 욕망은 버리고, ⟪k:1⟫백성을 위해 행동하십시오.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫당신이 지금 ⟪k:4⟫권력을 누리는 "
"것도 ⟪k:5⟫아버지의 인도입니다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6265D948_BF33_451C_9FC1_18A208A80109
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
