msgid "⟪k:0⟫As I have already told you, I will do no such thing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫몇 번이든 말씀드리겠습니다, ⟪k:1⟫영주님. ⟪k:2⟫그럴 수는…… 없습니다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D3B8B544_6A41_470D_AF26_189513A71C7B
